        },
        {
          "text": "Pele kwakasika abamwi basinsimi babeji akati kabantu, mbubonya mbukuyooba baiyi babeji akati kandinywe. Aba bayoonjizya kumbali injisyo zinyonyoona, bayootama naba Mwami wabo uwakabanununa, aboobo bayoofwambaana kuliletela lunyonyooko. ",
          "type": "text",
