        {
          "text": "Mululikumbuzyo lwabo bayoomunyanzya-nyanzya amajwi aalukukubiko. Nekubaboobo lubeteko ndubakabikilwa kalekale talukooyoomuka kusika, alwalo lunyonyooko lwabo talukonzyi koona,",
          "type": "text",
