        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi wakaibeteka minzi ya-Sodoma a-Gomora, wakaitenta amulilo mane kwakasyaala itwe luzutu, kuti cibe ciluuzyo kulibaabo beenda cakasampusampu, ",
          "type": "text",
