        },
        {
          "text": "aboobo balabisizigwa acibweedezyo cakubisya kwabo. Cintu cibabotela nkulilela lyoonse isikati. Ntotubala, ntotumpenda. Balalilela beni mumapobwe aabo ngobapobola akati kanu. ",
